# ---- Models (downloaded at runtime, never vendored) ----
# NOT "models/" — that pattern is unanchored and matches any directory of that name
# at any depth, which silently swallowed the entire io.github...themachine.models
# source package, its UI package and its tests. They built locally, where the files
# exist on disk, and only failed in CI. Match the downloaded artefacts by extension
# instead; the runtime model directory lives in app-private storage on the device
# and never appears in the repository at all.
*.gguf
*.bin
*.onnx
*.tar.bz2

# ---- IDE ----
.idea/
!.idea/icon.png
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# ---- Native build artifacts ----
app/.cxx/
app/src/main/cpp/build/
*.so.debug

# ---- Reports ----
app/build/reports/
build/reports/

# ---- Misc ----
.kotlin/
*.log

# Fetched and digest-checked by the fetchSherpaOnnx task, not committed.
app/libs/
